The workflow was initialized conservatively. Existing files were preserved; newly created truth files state what remains unknown instead of inventing product claims. If an answer is unclear, the agent should inspect repository evidence and offer two or three options plus one conservative default, but no suggestion becomes confirmed truth without the user's selection or confirmation.

Setup is complete only after every core owner is evaluated, target-local workflow/project/cold-start checks pass, acceptance evidence is saved, and installation identity is finalized. Optional overlays and modules remain conditional.
